    "Details": "The Crosscut is a popular type of LoggerMech, praised for operating efficiency in woodlands and dominating commercial forestry. The X5M is a slight improvement on the X2M, since it upgrades both the engine type and the gun. For the poor sods who have to ride a logger-mech into battle, the gun is particularly appreciated, since the new light AC/2 allows their industrial armor to stay far back from the fight.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Easy to Maintain</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.72</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
